{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 2, "text": "或十二个太阳同时存在于天空的神话。布依族古歌《十二个太阳》中说，人们炎热难熬，", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 274, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "或十二个太阳同时存在于天空的神话。布依族古歌《十二个太阳》中说，人们炎热难熬，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 274, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 3, "text": "天地干裂，庄稼枯萎，英雄卜丁愤而用箭射一个个太阳，只留下两个，“一个照白天，一个", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 334, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "天地干裂，庄稼枯萎，英雄卜丁愤而用箭射一个个太阳，只留下两个，“一个照白天，一个", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 334, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 4, "text": "照晚上”。《十二层天，十二层海》的故事里，第十二层天上只剩下了一个太阳，这是“卜丁", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 394, "w": 1544, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "照晚上”。《十二层天，十二层海》的故事里，第十二层天上只剩下了一个太阳，这是“卜丁", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 394, "w": 1544, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 5, "text": "射日”之后的事，不管神话怎么演化，布依族人还是从幻想中回到了现实，观察太阳的运", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 459, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "射日”之后的事，不管神话怎么演化，布依族人还是从幻想中回到了现实，观察太阳的运", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 459, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 6, "text": "行。摩经《古谢经》中说：“荡完拜荡完，荡完拜以扰”，直译“太阳走太阳，太阳走有常”", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 527, "w": 1524, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "行。摩经《古谢经》中说：“荡完拜荡完，荡完拜以扰”，直译“太阳走太阳，太阳走有常”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 527, "w": 1524, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 7, "text": "意译“太阳照样走，太阳很有规律地走”。太阳总是从“卡若”（东）出来，从“卡内”（西）", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 591, "w": 1540, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "意译“太阳照样走，太阳很有规律地走”。太阳总是从“卡若”（东）出来，从“卡内”（西）", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 591, "w": 1540, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 8, "text": "落山，也是“有常”的规律。这个规律使布依族据以判别方位，又据以分辨季节。", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 656, "w": 1379, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "落山，也是“有常”的规律。这个规律使布依族据以判别方位，又据以分辨季节。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 656, "w": 1379, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 9, "text": "日食，布依族同其他民族一样，过去认为是石蚌吞食太阳的现象，认日食与河边出", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 724, "w": 1455, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "日食，布依族同其他民族一样，过去认为是石蚌吞食太阳的现象，认日食与河边出", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 724, "w": 1455, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 10, "text": "现的彩虹有关，彩虹喝水意味着将会发生日食，这是想象，也是一种经验的总结。", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 793, "w": 1391, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "现的彩虹有关，彩虹喝水意味着将会发生日食，这是想象，也是一种经验的总结。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 793, "w": 1391, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 11, "text": "（二）对月亮的观察", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 857, "w": 346, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（二）对月亮的观察", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 857, "w": 346, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 12, "text": "月亮的来历和它的阴晴圆缺变化，在布依族的古歌和摩经中保存着许多描述，反映", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 917, "w": 1463, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "月亮的来历和它的阴晴圆缺变化，在布依族的古歌和摩经中保存着许多描述，反映", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 917, "w": 1463, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 13, "text": "出布依族先民们丰富的想象力，也有长期的观察和独特的理解。卜丁射日特地留下的两", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 986, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "出布依族先民们丰富的想象力，也有长期的观察和独特的理解。卜丁射日特地留下的两", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 986, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 14, "text": "个太阳中，一个仍然是炙热、发光的太阳；另一个原来同样是光亮照人的太阳，一经“掉到", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1046, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "个太阳中，一个仍然是炙热、发光的太阳；另一个原来同样是光亮照人的太阳，一经“掉到", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1046, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 15, "text": "牛滚凼，拿到河里洗，不会发光变月亮”。《开天辟地》古歌中也有翁戛在河里洗月亮，“洗", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1110, "w": 1540, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "牛滚凼，拿到河里洗，不会发光变月亮”。《开天辟地》古歌中也有翁戛在河里洗月亮，“洗", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1110, "w": 1540, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 16, "text": "得月亮白生生”（干净的意思）的描绘。中国古代有伏羲浴月的神话，但因为经过水洗将", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1171, "w": 1544, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "得月亮白生生”（干净的意思）的描绘。中国古代有伏羲浴月的神话，但因为经过水洗将", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1171, "w": 1544, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 17, "text": "太阳变成月亮却是布依族先民的畅想，似已认识到月亮不发光这个科学事实。", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1239, "w": 1351, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "太阳变成月亮却是布依族先民的畅想，似已认识到月亮不发光这个科学事实。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1239, "w": 1351, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 18, "text": "布依族观察月亮的阴晴圆缺变化，“月亮出来两头弯”", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 1300, "w": 941, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族观察月亮的阴晴圆缺变化，“月亮出来两头弯”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 1300, "w": 941, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 19, "text": "，“月亮出来像木梳”的直观形", "bbox_px": {"x": 1113, "y": 1299, "w": 540, "h": 68}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "，“月亮出来像木梳”的直观形", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1113, "y": 1299, "w": 540, "h": 68}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 20, "text": "象比喻和“十五月最明”的月圆日期，同娥眉月、凸月和满月的月相变化是一致的，他们还", "bbox_px": {"x": 108, "y": 1365, "w": 1540, "h": 66}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "象比喻和“十五月最明”的月圆日期，同娥眉月、凸月和满月的月相变化是一致的，他们还", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 108, "y": 1365, "w": 1540, "h": 66}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 21, "text": "把这个周期划分为三段，即月初黑、月中亮、月末黑，把月初黑和月末黑统称为黑月，月中", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1440, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "把这个周期划分为三段，即月初黑、月中亮、月末黑，把月初黑和月末黑统称为黑月，月中", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1440, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 22, "text": "亮称为亮月。", "bbox_px": {"x": 108, "y": 1502, "w": 230, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "亮称为亮月。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 108, "y": 1502, "w": 230, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 23, "text": "观察月食现象是牵动人心的。布依族先民不知道月食的成因，同其他民族的古老传", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 1565, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "观察月食现象是牵动人心的。布依族先民不知道月食的成因，同其他民族的古老传", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 1565, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 24, "text": "说一样，认为是动物吞吃月亮，是一种不祥之兆；在布依族先民看来还因失去月光而妨碍", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1633, "w": 1540, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "说一样，认为是动物吞吃月亮，是一种不祥之兆；在布依族先民看来还因失去月光而妨碍", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1633, "w": 1540, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 25, "text": "他们特别是晚间做家务活。所以，月食的时候家家户户都到户外去敲打锅盆，呼叫呐喊，", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1698, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "他们特别是晚间做家务活。所以，月食的时候家家户户都到户外去敲打锅盆，呼叫呐喊，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1698, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 26, "text": "以图驱逐正在吞食月亮的动物，消除险恶，还我光明。认为敢于吞食月亮的动物有蟾蜍、", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1762, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "以图驱逐正在吞食月亮的动物，消除险恶，还我光明。认为敢于吞食月亮的动物有蟾蜍、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1762, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 27, "text": "天狗和石蚌。他们也没有月偏食和月全食的概念，以为他们打天狗行动的迟早和力度，", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1823, "w": 1552, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "天狗和石蚌。他们也没有月偏食和月全食的概念，以为他们打天狗行动的迟早和力度，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1823, "w": 1552, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 28, "text": "直接关系到月亮被吞食的程度，也就是决定着月偏食还是月全食。《十二层天，十二层", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1887, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "直接关系到月亮被吞食的程度，也就是决定着月偏食还是月全食。《十二层天，十二层", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1887, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 29, "text": "海》中说当上天遨游的人来到十一层时，恰好看到了这个景象，歌中唱道：", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1951, "w": 1274, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "海》中说当上天遨游的人来到十一层时，恰好看到了这个景象，歌中唱道：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1951, "w": 1274, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 30, "text": "碰见都卡吃月亮呀，", "bbox_px": {"x": 438, "y": 2024, "w": 346, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "碰见都卡吃月亮呀，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 438, "y": 2024, "w": 346, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 300, "line_no": 31, "text": "吃去半边月亮，", "bbox_px": {"x": 434, "y": 2087, "w": 270, "h": 51}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "吃去半边月亮，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 434, "y": 2087, "w": 270, "h": 51}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
